# lens-lexicon.allow — retired-vocabulary hits that are correct as written.
#
# Format: <path><TAB><substring>. Both must match, so a new mention in an
# already-listed file still fires. Every entry needs a reason above it: this
# file is where the judgment is recorded, not where it is hidden.

# The format-version requirement (b1baa51bd7a9) records the pre-versioning
# profile format as a deliberate breaking change; these two leaves describe
# that retired format by its section names, historically — the mentions are
# the record of what was broken away from, not live vocabulary.
spec/schema/arch_profile_loader.md	retired `edges`/`hashed_fields` format
spec/schema/test_schema_loading.md	earlier `edges`/`hashed_fields` format
